ULTRIX SQL RETIRING

Highlights

o  Last order date: September 4, 1992; last ship date: September 30, 1992

o  Cost-effective migration program available

Retirement Program

Digital is announcing the retirement of ULTRIX SQL software effective with 
the release of the ULTRIX V4.3 operating system. Therefore the ULTRIX SQL 
license will not be packaged with the ULTRIX V4.3 product or with any 
subsequent versions. Maintenance and support for the ULTRIX SQL product will 
be provided until December 31, 1993.

Product Description

The ULTRIX SQL product is a full-featured RDBMS engine that is licensed at 
"no-charge" with the ULTRIX operating system on many VAX systems, and with 
all RISC-based DECstation and DECsystem computers. The Ingres V6.3 
technology forms the basis for the ULTRIX SQL V2.0 product.

Migration Solution

Digital has negotiated a cost-effective migration program with Ingres 
Corporation that allows current ULTRIX users to purchase a low-cost 
migration kit for the native INGRES database. This program includes a 
cost-effective migration for the INGRES Application Development Tools.  
ULTRIX SQL users who desire information on how to purchase the Ingres 
migration kit as a replacement for the ULTRIX SQL product can telephone 
Ingres at 800-4INGRES.

Please contact your local Digital sales office for more information.



