Tracy,

As noted in earlier, all of the information regarding the Alpha *chip* is
publicly available.  It's been announced (with a part number and price) as a chip-level product.  It's been shipping since June to our Alpha partners - Cray Research, Olivetti, Kobuta Pacific.

What is still considered proprietary is information about the *systems* (workstations and servers) that Digital will build that incorporate the Alpha Chip.  Our commitment is to publicly announce system-level products by year-end and ship those products in roughly the same timeframe.  Upgrade paths from today's products were publicly announced in July.

