The clock rate is indeed 150Mhz, and a ECL clock generator must be used.
However, to avoid the problems (near imposibilities) of running busses at
150MHz, the 21064 allows you to scale down the clock used for external
transfers by many different ratios.  Thus, you get your 150 MHz on the
inside, can choose say a 50 Mhz or 25 Mhz external busses.

