   Vol 5c run-time lib - screen management, string manipulation
   Vol 6a file system - uide to file appl,analyze,convert/reclaim,FDL, NCS
   Vol 6b file system - RMS
   Vol 7a system programming - I/O user's part I, part II
   Vol 7b system programming - delta/Xdelta, system dump analyzer
   Vol 8  device support - device support manual
   Vol 9  Vax macro - vax macro and instruction set

General User
   Vol 1  general info - master index, gen user master index, glossary
   Vol 2a using vms - intro, guide to vms, guide to files and devices
   Vol 2b using vms - mail, phone, sort/merge
   Vol 3  using dcl - dcl concepts, guide to using command procedures
