inspection the hard disk fails its power on tests. All the front panel
light stay on and the disk does not spin up.

	After checking the connecting cables to no avail I decided to
RTFM and settled down to read the R80 disk drive user guide
(EK-00R80-UG-001) and, lo and behold, on page 2-9 I found the microcode
diagnostic checkout procedure. So armed only with a screwdriver I opened
up the powered up disk drive and set about the tests. All seems okay
until I got to step 4 which says,

	a. Set the thumbwheel switches to "22."
